t DJ Nibbles is running for re-election - and you've been hired to stop him at all costs. Who cares that you're a random ride-share driver who didn't even know an election was happening? That doesn't mean you can't run the purrfect campaign!\n\nCan you handle the world of Presidential politics? Do you even know what a campaign manager does? Will you find love or heartbreak with your candidate? Leading the purrlitical revolution is up to you!\n\nBecause wouldn't things be better if humans weren't in charge?", "summary": "The cats are back to win your heart - and your vote in Cat President 2: Purrlitical Revolution, a satirical otome game! With a script that's over 100,000 words long, Cat President 2 is a visual novel packed full of romance, humor and cute pictures of cats. Fans of the first game and newcomers alike are sure to enjoy this game! Cast your vote today!", "themes": [{"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}, {"id": 44, "name": "Romance"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/cat-president-2-purrlitical-revolution", "videos": [{"id": 66764, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "N-DHAni1y7Y", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=N-DHAni1y7Y", "title": "Cat President 2: Purrlitical Revolution (teaser trailer)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/N-DHAni1y7Y/hqdefault.jpg"}]}